    "msgid": "msg_sent_1001",
    "text": "晚上建议清淡一点，主食选糙米或杂粮，搭配一份鱼或豆腐，再来两拳头的绿叶菜。记得避开海鲜。",
    "sentAt": 1794187020000,
    "source": "archive",
    "sandbox": false,
    "createdAt": 1794187080000
  },
  {
    "id": "dly_02",
    "tenantId": "tn_01j9z3k4m5n6p7q8r9s0t1u2v3",
    "draftId": "draft_1002",
    "version": 1,
    "advisorId": "adv_02",
    "groupId": "grp_02",
    "roomId": "wr_demo_grp_02",
    "msgid": "msg_sent_1002",
    "text": "一碗牛肉面不算失控，关键是面量。下次可以少一点面、加一份青菜，晚上正常吃、别刻意不吃。",
    "sentAt": 1794188700000,
    "source": "archive",
    "sandbox": false,
    "createdAt": 1794188760000
  },
  {
    "id": "dly_03",
    "tenantId": "tn_01j9z3k4m5n6p7q8r9s0t1u2v3",
    "draftId": "draft_1003",
    "version": 1,
    "advisorId": "adv_03",
    "groupId": "grp_05",
    "roomId": "wr_demo_grp_05",
    "msgid": "msg_sent_1003",
    "text": "偶尔晚睡不用太焦虑。今晚可以试着把手机放到床边以外，睡前用 10 分钟做点放松，明早固定时间起床。",
    "sentAt": 1794190260000,
    "source": "archive",
    "sandbox": false,
    "createdAt": 1794190320000
  },
  {
    "id": "dly_04",
    "tenantId": "tn_01j9z3k4m5n6p7q8r9s0t1u2v3",
    "draftId": "draft_1004",
    "version": 2,
    "advisorId": "adv_01",
    "groupId": "grp_03",
    "roomId": "wr_demo_grp_03",
    "msgid": "msg_sent_1004",
    "text": "产后前几个月容易累，先别急着下结论。可以留意睡眠和饮食，如果持续加重或伴随发热、伤口异常，建议尽快线下就诊。",
    "sentAt": 1794191940000,
    "source": "archive",
    "sandbox": false,
    "createdAt": 1794192000000
  },
  {
    "id": "dly_05",
    "tenantId": "tn_01j9z3k4m5n6p7q8r9s0t1u2v3",
    "draftId": "draft_1005",
    "version": 3,
    "advisorId": "adv_02",
    "groupId": "grp_02",
    "roomId": "wr_demo_grp_02",
    "msgid": "msg_sent_1005",
    "text": "药物方面我不能给建议，也不建议自行购买。我们可以先把饮食和作息调整起来，具体用药请让医生评估，我帮你把问题记下来转给顾问。",
    "sentAt": 1794193980000,
    "source": "archive",
    "sandbox": false,
    "createdAt": 1794194040000
  },
  {
    "id": "dly_06",
    "tenantId": "tn_01j9z3k4m5n6p7q8r9s0t1u2v3",
    "draftId": "draft_1006",
    "version": 1,
    "advisorId": "adv_01",
    "groupId": "grp_01",
    "roomId": "wr_demo_grp_01",
    "msgid": "msg_sent_1006",
    "text": "六千步已经不错了，保持就好。饭后可以慢走十分钟。",
    "sentAt": 1794194760000,
    "source": "archive",
    "sandbox": false,
